Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 10:12:49 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(ub_lock): consolidate lock safety fixes

9eefc9b25db856a9a4ac2fdd82ee5595d68481c0 fix(ub_lock): validate reader lane before decrementing global reference
0cc3b266ce86d739d6687d8f3100484e36989f34 test(ub_lock): document offline recovery contract and preserve live owners
f6e3da2eb381c3fa5eac2cbc3dea70472f28d413 fix(ub_lock): separate initialization states from ready references
bacea853e22c7a3eedf2498a9de1916d9da4bf3c fix(ub_lock): rebuild delayed tokens without a recovery thread owner
7cf10cbb4f0396ecf8589e586de798b4eb5c4656 fix(ub_lock): reject unlock notification without a transport
0624e88ac023230b8ace8dceaf3bf94fa3a26b9c fix(ub_lock): use owner node shift constant in mutex diagnostics
f1f968377be4a1fea2fd04c5e4a97193e99da6e2 fix(ub_lock): validate SX flag before mutating local ownership
